# it holds fewer than two: the only Forest enters tapped, the Memnite goes back on the bottom, and "Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" is
# a separate instruction (CR 608.2c) that still happens. Only the activator's library is looked at: Bot2's stays as it was.

